    "page_intro": {
      "en": "Sage the tortoise grows word families from a single root! Big words often grow from a smaller root word you already know — farm grows into farmer. Read the root, then tap the word that GROWS from it (watch out for words that just look alike). A Grade 2 vocabulary game about using root words as a clue to meaning, aligned to Common Core L.2.4.c.",
